{#- Closing coaching CTA, shared by the three catalog index pages and the hub
    pages that don't carry bespoke copy. Added Aug 6, 2026: /planes/ and its
    EN/PT siblings ended on the plan grid with no next step at all, while every
    other plan page promoted 1:1 coaching. Copy lives in planUi.json so the
    three languages stay in one place. Hubs with their own tailored CTA
    (running, triatlon, hyrox, bajar-de-peso, ciclismo, natacion, ironman) keep
    theirs — this is the default, not a replacement. -#}
{%- set c = planUi[lang] -%}
<section class="cta-final">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="label">{{ c.ctaEyebrow }}</span>
    <h2>{{ c.ctaHeading }}</h2>
    <p>{{ c.ctaBody }}</p>
    <a href="{{ c.ctaHref }}" class="btn-primary">{{ c.ctaButton }}</a>
  </div>
</section>
